# =============================================================
# UE5 Project - Git tracks ONLY modified/custom files
# Everything else can be recreated from:
#   1. Third Person template (UE 5.7)
#   2. Game Animation Sample migration
# =============================================================

# Ignore EVERYTHING by default
*

# ---- Allow project config ----
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!MyProject4.uproject

# ---- Allow ALL C++ source code ----
!Source/
!Source/**

# ---- Allow modified blueprints ----
# SandboxCharacter_CMC (reparented, EventGraph modified)
!Content/Blueprints/SandboxCharacter_CMC.uasset
!Content/Blueprints/SandboxCharacter_CMC.uexp

# IMC_Sandbox (WASD remapped + IA_ComboAttack added)
!Content/Variant_Sandbox/
!Content/Variant_Sandbox/Input/
!Content/Variant_Sandbox/Input/IMC_Sandbox.uasset
!Content/Variant_Sandbox/Input/IMC_Sandbox.uexp

# ---- Allow the test level ----
!Content/Variant_SideScrolling/
!Content/Variant_SideScrolling/Lvl_SideScrolling.umap
!Content/Variant_SideScrolling/Lvl_SideScrolling.uexp

# ---- Exclude build artifacts even if inside allowed folders ----
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Build/
.vs/
*.sln